# 📄 Chat with PDF using LLM, RAG & LangChain

## Overview

This project allows users to upload one or multiple PDF documents and interact with them using natural language. The application uses Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) to retrieve the most relevant document chunks before generating accurate responses with a Large Language Model.

The project demonstrates how to build an intelligent document assistant capable of answering questions based on user-provided documents.

---

## Features

* Upload PDF documents
* Automatic text extraction
* Text chunking
* Embedding generation
* Vector database indexing
* Semantic search
* Context-aware question answering
* Simple and interactive web interface

---

## Tech Stack

* Python
* LangChain
* Hugging Face
* ChromaDB / FAISS
* Streamlit
* Sentence Transformers

---

## Project Workflow

PDF → Text Extraction → Chunking → Embedding → Vector Store → Retrieval → LLM → Answer

